1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,300
Sophocles' play
Oedipus the King

2
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:04,433
remembers the
riddling Sphinx,

3
00:00:04,433 --> 00:00:05,267
but it never gives

4
00:00:05,267 --> 00:00:07,167
the words of the riddle.

5
00:00:07,167 --> 00:00:08,700
Later writers do:

6
00:00:08,700 --> 00:00:09,933
what has one voice,

7
00:00:09,933 --> 00:00:11,533
and becomes
four-footed,

8
00:00:11,533 --> 00:00:13,767
two-footed, and
three-footed?

9
00:00:13,767 --> 00:00:15,267
A human being.

10
00:00:15,267 --> 00:00:16,667
In these texts, there is

11
00:00:16,667 --> 00:00:19,500
no morning,
noon, or evening.

12
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Full story on Quiet Origins
